      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKNROLL COWBOY (1) impressed when fresh from a spell last start, leading from the outside barrier to score by 3m at Menangle. Progressive gelding who has the speed to take advantage of the inside draw so can take this next step. BETWEEN DECKS (2) has been racing well from the back row, scoring at Bathurst before a second last week at Newcastle. Came from wider to win the last time he raced here so should enjoy the good draw. SUNSET STRIDE (6) enjoyed the drop from city grade in a last-start win by 1.8 metres at Newcastle. Draws wider but could go on with it along with BETTINE (5) who raced parked but was tough in a win by 8 metres at this circuit and distance last week.",
